<div style="font-family: sans-serif; padding: 20px; line-height: 1.5; color: #333;">
  <h2 style="color: #d9534f;">⚠️ Database Backup Failed</h2>
  <p>Hello <%= name %>,</p>
  <p>This is an automated alert to notify you that the database backup process has failed.</p>
  <div style="background-color: #f8d7da; border: 1px solid #f5c6cb; padding: 15px; border-radius: 4px; color: #721c24; margin: 20px 0; font-family: monospace;">
    <strong>Error Details:</strong><br/>
    <%= errorDetails %>
  </div>
  <p>Please check the server logs immediately to resolve this issue.</p>
  <hr style="border: 0; border-top: 1px solid #eee; margin: 20px 0;"/>
  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #777;">This email was sent automatically by RiseTogetherBD / Server Squad backend.</p>
</div>
